  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Action Roll",
    "section": "6.6",
    "heading": "5. Add Bonus Dice",
    "lineStart": 342,
    "lineEnd": 348
  },
  "section": "6.6",
  "rulesText": "You can normally get two bonus dice for your action roll (some special abilities might give you additional bonus dice).\n\nFor one bonus die, you can get **assistance** from a teammate. They take 1 stress, say how they help you, and give you +1d.\n\nFor another bonus die, you can either **push yourself** (take 2 stress) or you can accept a **Devil's Bargain** (you can't get dice for both, it's one or the other)."
}
